  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_01_01",
      "hash64": "BCFAFC19AC13B591",
      "text": "把食材这样……\\n然后再把调味料那样……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_01_02",
      "hash64": "BCFAF919AC13B078",
      "text": "……啊，抱歉！\\n刚才我在思考！\\c\\n我在研究三明治的食谱。\\c\\n总有一天我要实现梦想，那就是\\n研究出能被誉为大师级的极致食谱！\\c\\n如果你不介意的话，\\n就让我传授给你三明治的食谱吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_addrecipe_01",
      "hash64": "137D7D3A756A2A67",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n可以制作新的三明治了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_addrecipe_02",
      "hash64": "137D7E3A756A2C1A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n可以制作新的大师级三明治了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_01_03",
      "hash64": "BCFAFA19AC13B22B",
      "text": "这可是好吃到下巴都要掉下来，\\n试着做做看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_01_04",
      "hash64": "BCFAFF19AC13BAAA",
      "text": "我要是想出新食谱的话，\\n再传授给你哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_02_01",
      "hash64": "63C63C0064C28F1E",
      "text": "……啊，是你啊！\\n我想出新食谱了哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_01",
      "hash64": "B9BEE807FFCF4AB3",
      "text": "……啊，是你啊！\\c\\n我现在正在研究的食谱\\n需要很稀有的调味料。\\c\\n名字叫做秘传～什么的，\\n总共有５种调味料……\\c\\n只要能看上一眼那些调味料，\\n我或许就能想出新食谱了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_02",
      "hash64": "B9BEE907FFCF4C66",
      "text": "那个秘传～什么的，\\n总共有５种调味料……\\c\\n只要能看上一眼那些调味料，\\n我或许就能想出新食谱了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_03",
      "hash64": "B9BEEA07FFCF4E19",
      "text": "你拿着的那、那个！\\n不就是那个秘传～什么的吗！？\\r\\n呜呜……啊，啊啊……\\r\\n我的脑海中浮现出了食谱～！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_04",
      "hash64": "B9BEEB07FFCF4FCC",
      "text": "呼，呼……\\n我创作出了惊人的食谱！\\r\\n这正是极致的三明治……！\\r\\n请一定试着制作看看……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_05",
      "hash64": "B9BEEC07FFCF517F",
      "text": "多亏了你，所有大师级三明治的\\n构想全部成为了现实！\\c\\n真的非常感谢你\\n在我的逐梦之路上给予的帮助！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_06",
      "hash64": "B9BEED07FFCF5332",
      "text": "这个世界上一定有\\n尚无人知的美味三明治！\\c\\n你要是也想出新食谱的话，\\n别忘了和其他人分享哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
